do GameState.learn_fact("j_clairvoyance")
join Valerie left [animation="Instant In"]
join Lizzy right [animation="Slide From Right"]
Valerie: Elizabeth, excellent. How are you faring?
Lizzy: All I've managed to accomplish so far is be eaten by zombies twice and stabbed.
update Valerie [animation="Bounce" length="0.4" wait="true"]
Valerie: Don't tell me you confronted Lady MacDeath alone...
Lizzy: What? It seemed like the best idea.
Valerie: Oh, Lizzy... perhaps it's good that there's a time loop. It could teach you a valuable lesson.
Lizzy: What ever. I'm done with learning.

Valerie: Have you had any luck with figuring out how to convince the others?
Lizzy: Well, Barb hasn’t tried on her dress yet, not while she’s taking that terrible math exam.
Lizzy: Noah gets hauled to detention and then the hospital.
Valerie: Oh dear...
Lizzy: Um. Juniper is kinda floaty. She hasn’t really held a long conversation with me.
Lizzy: It’s weird.
Valerie: The time loop is probably affecting her more than the others because of her clairvoyance.
Valerie: I’m not well versed in the science behind psychic abilities, but they’re often sensitive to even the tiniest changes in the paranatural.
Lizzy: poor Juniper. I better stop what ever magic Lady MacDeath is using.
Valerie: If it’s indeed magic. It may be something else...
Lizzy: I guess I’ll go try and convince either Noah or Barb.
Lizzy: You know, she told me this crazy story about getting lost and eating a bug.
Valerie: It’s alright, you don’t have to tell me.
Valerie: good luck.
Lizzy: Thanks.
do GameState.make_item_collectible("sewing_kit")
do ProgressionTracker.complete_requirement("3A", "library_dialog")
do GameState.mark_characters_as_spoken(["valerie"])